### ParrePOS Requests - Cobertura por waves
# Wave 1: auth/me, customers/items/invoices (ver docs/api.md para contrato completo)
# Wave 2 (incluye 2.1/2.2): POS, caja, cash movements, sync, handshake/status
# Wave 3-4: fiscal opcional, documentos, retries, metricas, webhook
# Wave 5: ops metrics/conflicts, inventario integrado y hardening smoke
# Wave 6: compras/proveedores, transferencias/conteos, crm, cxc, reportes, integraciones y fiscal prod opcional
# Wave 7 (bloque A): matriz modular extendida + payments_plus opcional

### Health
GET http://localhost/health

### Login
POST http://localhost/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_slug": "demo",
  "email": "admin@demo.local",
  "password": "Admin12345!"
}

### Me
GET http://localhost/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: status
GET http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/status
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Fiscal: config OFF (default no fiscal)
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/config
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fiscal": {
    "enabled": false,
    "dgii_registered": false,
    "ncf_type": "B01",
    "series": "B01",
    "provider": "MOCK",
    "provider_url": "",
    "signing_secret": ""
  }
}

### Fiscal: config ON (requiere DGII true)
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/fiscal/config
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fiscal": {
    "enabled": true,
    "dgii_registered": true,
    "ncf_type": "B01",
    "series": "B01",
    "provider": "MOCK",
    "provider_url": "",
    "signing_secret": "tenant-secret-demo",
    "emission_limits": {
      "daily_max": 0,
      "monthly_max": 0
    }
  },
  "profile": {
    "legal_name": "Demo Fiscal SRL",
    "rnc": "131452987",
    "environment": "CERT",
    "status": "ACTIVE"
  }
}

