### Admin SaaS: habilitar módulo accounting en tenant 1
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/admin/tenants/1/modules
Content-Type: application/json
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platform_admin_key}}

{
  "modules": {
    "accounting": {"enabled": true}
  }
}

### Accounting: obtener account-map
GET http://localhost/api/v1/accounting/account-map
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Accounting: upsert account-map
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/accounting/account-map
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entries": [
    {"map_key": "sales.revenue", "account_code": "4100", "description": "Ingresos por ventas", "active": true},
    {"map_key": "sales.itbis", "account_code": "2101", "description": "ITBIS por pagar", "active": true},
    {"map_key": "purchases.expense", "account_code": "5100", "description": "Compras", "active": true}
  ]
}

