### Admin SaaS: habilitar módulo hardware_bridge en tenant 1
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/admin/tenants/1/modules
Content-Type: application/json
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platform_admin_key}}

{
  "modules": {
    "hardware_bridge": {"enabled": true}
  }
}

### Hardware: registrar dispositivo
POST http://localhost/api/v1/hardware/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_id": 1,
  "register_id": 1,
  "device_code": "PRN-CAJA-01",
  "name": "Impresora Caja 1",
  "type": "PRINTER",
  "connection": {"driver": "mock", "host": "127.0.0.1", "port": 9100}
}

### Hardware: listar dispositivos
GET http://localhost/api/v1/hardware/devices?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Hardware: crear print job
POST http://localhost/api/v1/hardware/print-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: hw-print-001

{
  "device_id": 1,
  "sale_id": 1,
  "template": "POS_TICKET",
  "idempotency_key": "hw-print-001",
  "payload": {
    "ticket_number": "T-1001",
    "total": 450
  }
}

### Hardware: listar print jobs
GET http://localhost/api/v1/hardware/print-jobs?status=QUEUED&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Hardware: abrir gaveta
