### Admin SaaS: habilitar módulo backup_ops en tenant 1
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/admin/tenants/1/modules
Content-Type: application/json
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platform_admin_key}}

{
  "modules": {
    "backup_ops": {"enabled": true}
  }
}

### BackupOps: crear snapshot lógico
POST http://localhost/api/v1/backup/snapshots
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "snapshot_type": "LOGICAL",
  "metadata": {
    "scope": "tenant_full",
    "notes": "Snapshot operativo previo a mantenimiento"
  }
}

### BackupOps: listar snapshots
GET http://localhost/api/v1/backup/snapshots?status=DONE&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### BackupOps: crear restore run
POST http://localhost/api/v1/backup/restores
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "backup_snapshot_id": 1,
  "mode": "DRY_RUN",
  "summary": {
    "requested_reason": "Prueba de recuperación controlada"
  }
}

### BackupOps: listar restore runs
GET http://localhost/api/v1/backup/restores?status=DONE&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### BackupOps: runbook técnico
GET http://localhost/api/v1/backup/runbook
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Admin SaaS: habilitar módulo security_plus en tenant 1
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/admin/tenants/1/modules
Content-Type: application/json
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platform_admin_key}}

{
  "modules": {
    "security_plus": {"enabled": true}
  }
}

### SecurityPlus: estado módulo/usuario
GET http://localhost/api/v1/security-plus/status
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### SecurityPlus: enrolar MFA TOTP
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/security-plus/mfa/totp
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "TOTP",
  "secret": "demo-super-secret"
}

### SecurityPlus: verificar MFA TOTP
POST http://localhost/api/v1/security-plus/mfa/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "TOTP",
  "code": "123456"
}

### SecurityPlus: listar métodos MFA
GET http://localhost/api/v1/security-plus/mfa/methods
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### SecurityPlus: rotar secreto operativo
POST http://localhost/api/v1/security-plus/secrets/rotate
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "secret_key": "platform.api_key",
  "new_secret": "nuevo-secreto-seguro-2026"
}

### SecurityPlus: listar rotaciones
GET http://localhost/api/v1/security-plus/secrets/rotations?secret_key=platform.api_key&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

