### Ops: upsert reglas de alertas
PUT http://localhost/api/v1/ops/alerts/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entries": [
    {
      "code": "sync_error_high",
      "metric_key": "sync.error_rate_pct",
      "comparator": "GTE",
      "threshold_value": 5,
      "severity": "WARN",
      "channel": "INTERNAL",
      "enabled": true
    }
  ]
}

